	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"text"},
		line=727,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat030160"},
		line=727,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"It would ordinarily be packed around this time, but today, Miyoshi has already hung up its “CLOSED” sign.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"The only patrons present are me, Akari, Hotori, and the manager.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Tomorrow's the big day.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you for everything you've done for me.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Please, no need to get so sentimental on me here.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“All I ever did was pick you up off the streets, give you a place to live, provide you with a job...”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Huh, come to think of it, I really have done a whole lot for you!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Save the jokes for some other time.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, my apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Anyway, no more talking like we won't ever see each other again.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I'll be waiting for the good news around this time tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I return his gentle smile with a bow.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Oh, that's right! It won't be much help to you tomorrow, but I did prepare this for you.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"At the manager's signal, Mutsumi-san brings out an enormous flower arrangement from the back of the restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“Well, well, Soujin-kun, what kind of flowers are these?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"The manager gestures towards a row of ten meticulously arranged stems with lush, grooved leaves and pale golden petals the shape of a fish's tail.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Truly beautiful flowers indeed.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Gladiolus flowers.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“That's it!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The manager triumphantly waves a finger around.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“In floriography, they signify victory.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As well as clandestine meetings and precaution.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“You really didn't have to mention those other two...”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That first meaning totally suits us to a tee.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“That's the spirit, that's the spirit!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Takahito"},
			{
"“I know no better way to express my feelings. May\nOomikami's blessing be with you tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you very much, Manager.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"We all lower our heads in appreciation.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"I owe the manager a debt I could never hope to repay.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"The most I can hope to do is devote all of myself to the enormous task before us.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Well then, I believe it is time I unveil my own little secret weapon.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san disappears again to the back of the restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"She returns momentarily, supporting a certain someone on her shoulder.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Long time no see, you lot.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Thank you for waiting. I have one Maki Kazuma, extra sour, right here.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Think you can handle me?”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki, should you really be moving yet?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Like hell I'd be showing you this sorry state otherwise.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"Leaning on Mutsumi-san all the while, Maki hobbles his way over to an empty chair.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Maki just barely managed to survive Kokuan-dono's rescue operation, but he suffered terrible wounds in the process.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Even with Kotone's prodigious healing magicks, he can still barely move his legs.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Fuckin' hell... Been waitin' for this moment for three damn years, yet here I am, lame as a duck.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“I do apologize. Not much of a warrior in his state, this one.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, fuck off!”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Kazuma's angry roar echoes throughout the empty restaurant.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Hearing that thunderous voice of his for the first time in a long while brings a smile to my face.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Sorry, chairman, but I ain't gonna be much use in a fight.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“With the state I'm in, I'd only hold you back.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't be. Just seeing your face is enough to raise my spirits.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You may rest assured that we will strike down Okonogi and reclaim our Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Countin' on you, chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You'd better not hold anythin' back this time. Whip out Shiranui right from the start, you hear?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Oh, don't remind me.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Hotori replies, an easy smile on her face.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, even though I can't fight, you'll have her in my place.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You tryna play dumb with me now?! I'll fuck you up!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oof, that smarts...!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Kazuma grunts in pain, clutching at his leg.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Ehehee, please watch what you say, Kazuma-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...You're really going to join us?”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Indeed. All of our blades stand ready at your disposal.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“The warriors of the Shiseikan have made their final preparations and await your command.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The Shiseikan is the blade arts dojo of House Sarashina.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"It'd be a tremendous boon to the Sworn Blades if their disciples were to join our ranks.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But... why the sudden change of heart?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“It has been far too long since I have beheld Shiranui's true form.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“That is all there is to it.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san takes a sidelong glance at Kazuma.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Let her have it for bein' AWOL all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Please do go easy on me, chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Glad to have you back, Mutsumi.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san shows Hotori her unwaveringly placid smile.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"She then moves to kneel before Akari.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Your Imperial Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Sarashina Mutsumi, master of the Shiseikan, offers her deepest apologies for our protracted absence.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“For Your Imperial Highness's sake, our lives and blades are humbly at your service.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Akari regards her impassively.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"A serene smile plays across her lips, as though she knew from the very start that Mutsumi-san would rejoin our ranks.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Those are some awfully promising words.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I expect great things, Mutsumi.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Mutsumi"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"Mutsumi-san offers Akari a deep bow.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			{
"In the middle of my daily training, I hear a soft knock on the door.",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I check to find that it's just past two of the clock.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's me. Can I come in?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Go ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"The door slides open, and Akari enters.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, you're still up.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The lights were out, so I thought you were sleeping.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I can focus better when I train in the dark.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"I wipe the sweat off my brow with a handkerchief.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Still training right before the big day? Shouldn't you get some rest?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm just going through the routine I'm used to.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Besides, couldn't I ask you the same thing?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I couldn't fall asleep no matter what.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Can we chat for a bit?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll turn on the lights.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's fine. The moonlight is more than enough.”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"Akari sits down on the floor.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"The moonbeams streaming in through the window bathe her in their pale radiance.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Tomorrow really is the big day, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks for staying beside me all this time.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Save your gratitude for after we succeed.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, you have a point...”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But c'mon, what's the harm?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"Akari trails off with a pout on her face.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"She must have a still heart indeed if she can show off such an easygoing expression at a time like this.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Even when it comes right down to it, she has nerves of steel.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's easy to get caught up in the fervor of battle and want to rush to the front.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I want you to stay behind me, no matter what.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I understand.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll be right there to watch your back when it matters most.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I feel safer already.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll be glad to focus on what's right before me without needing to worry.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin...”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Akari picks herself up and sits down right in front of me.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Her face is close enough to touch.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"She slowly reaches out her hands and clasps my own in their warm grip.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Her amaranthine eyes peer right into mine.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Will I get to see you in your finest hour tomorrow?”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's what I'm praying for.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If anything should happen to me, you must face forward and keep moving.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am just one among many fighting for the restoration of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We warriors need one such as you to survive to the end and bear witness to the way we lived and died.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's my duty as a lord, right?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"I nod in solemn reply.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"A firm strength pours into my hands.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Believe in me.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I won't ever avert my gaze.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll do my duty, so you do yours.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Akari's resolute gaze lights a fire within me.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"With her as my lord, I can pour out the full measure of my devotion without any hesitation in my heart.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Akari withdraws her hands from mine with an air of reluctance.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Even in the darkness, her eyes shine ever so brightly.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hearing you talk with Kanami and Elsa made me proud to be your vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Did I say anything that impressed you?”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You showed me the attitude a true Empress ought possess.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Her gaze wanders as she thinks back to what she said.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't think I said anything all that special.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's what I honestly believe.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's all the better.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Mere sophistry could never be enough to truly move\nsomeone's heart.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"She was only able to gain Kanami and Elsa's confidence because she spoke from the depth of her own heart.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"To comment on it would be presumptuous of me, but I do think that Akari grew more mature from her confrontations with Elsa and Kanami.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I know you said that you have no attachment to the throne, but I want to see you on it all the same.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Empire deserves no less than that.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is that an actual compliment I just heard from you? Better pray the sky doesn't fall down on me tomorrow.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I really mean it.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hehehee, that's nice of you to say.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Akari stands up, a serene smile on her face.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that's how you feel, I won't argue otherwise.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Show me your best and place me atop the throne.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"That endlessly lucent smile of hers is enough to put even the moon itself to shame.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
